for (Contact c : contacts) {
    String e = normalize(c.Email);
    if (e != null && !byEmail.containsKey(e)) {   // first-in-order wins
        byEmail.put(e, c.Id);
    }
}
```

But for a one-shot import of a few thousand rows the extra abstraction isn't worth it, and the task explicitly favours the readable nested loop.

